# Hindi Translation Style — Colloquial, Not Textbook

## Core Principle

Write Hindi the way real people talk — like a friend explaining ज्योतिष over chai, not a Sanskrit textbook. Our audience is everyday Hindi speakers in India, including elderly users who prefer Hindi but are comfortable with common English words.

## Tone

- **Warm and direct** — "अपनी कुंडली देखें" not "कृपया अपनी जन्म कुंडली अवलोकित करें"
- **Hinglish is fine** — Use English words when Hindi speakers naturally would: check, score, position, timeline, health, free, profile, download
- **Short labels** — UI text should be punchy: "चालू" not "सक्रिय", "बदलें" not "संपादित करें"
- **No shudh Hindi** — Avoid overly Sanskritized words that nobody uses in conversation

## Word Choices

| ❌ Avoid (textbook) | ✅ Use (colloquial) |
|---------------------|---------------------|
| सक्रिय / निष्क्रिय | चालू / बंद |
| प्रबल / दुर्बल | मज़बूत / कमज़ोर |
| अनुकूल / चुनौतीपूर्ण | अच्छा / कठिन |
| शेष | बाकी |
| अवलोकन करें | देखें |
| संपादित करें | बदलें |
| निरस्तीकरण | भंग |
| ब्रह्मांडीय रूपरेखा | किस्मत का नक्शा |
| वार्षिक भविष्यवाणी | साल का फल |
| स्वास्थ्य एवं आयु | सेहत और उम्र |
| सुलभता | सुविधा |

## SEO & Long Text

- SEO intros should read like someone *explaining* — "कुंडली असल में आपके जन्म के वक़्त आसमान का नक्शा है"
- Use "यानी" and "मतलब" to clarify jargon naturally
- Keep sentences short. Mix Hindi and English naturally.
- FAQ answers should sound like a pandit ji answering warmly, not a Wikipedia article

## Jyotish Terms — Keep As-Is

Sanskrit astrology terms stay unchanged — they're the same in Hindi:
कुंडली, दशा, महादशा, अंतर्दशा, नक्षत्र, राशि, भाव, लग्न, गोचर, योग, दोष, अयनांश, तिथि, षड्बल, अष्टकवर्ग

## New Key Checklist

When adding a new i18n key to `hi.ts`:
1. Read it aloud — does it sound like something you'd say to your दादी/नानी?
2. If it sounds like Google Translate or a government document, rewrite it
3. Check if there's a common Hinglish alternative (e.g., "डाउनलोड" > "अधोभारण")
4. Keep it under ~40 chars for button/label text
